  m_text: 'Controls:

    - ZQSD to move

    - Space to jump (Auto bunny jump is
    ON)

    - R to respawn

    - Hold right click to use hookshot

    - Shift
    to be pull by the hookshot

    - CTRL to activate Slow Motion

    - ESC to
    open the pause menu'
